{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8fb9311786e13326805266961b0463ddf1489c7c8eb67183274c9056df9e1009", "ja": "ココロ、すれ違い", "zh": "心之交错", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c563aaccf36991b4bb95341207e9739df8b4669f3f623754866611de134b680e", "ja": "律子は、可憐のパートナーは自分ではなく、\nもっと可愛い子がいいと主張。「もともと代\n役のつもりだった」……そう聞いた可憐は泣\nき出す。やってきた公演メンバーやプロデュ\nーサーに言われ、ふたりは話し合う事に。", "zh": "律子坚持认为，比起自己，可怜的搭档\n还是选更可爱的女孩子比较好。可怜听到\n她说“本来就只是打算当个替补”后便哭\n了起来。在赶来的演出成员和制作人的劝\n说下，两人决定好好谈一谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e4a1a6d6562aaa8feeed46cd37156ace6454ff1192f750b27471931a4379a671", "ja": "（律子から、話があると切り出された……。\nいったい何の話だろう？　いや、もしかして……）", "zh": "（律子说有话要跟我谈……\n到底是什么事呢？不，难道说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "ed926e4c4406c52ba478bc2a0c5bfec213b9da9246eb47baa7a8a47ba8e972a0", "ja": "ええと、可憐の新曲の相手なんですけど。\nそろそろ、ちゃんとした相手を選びませんか？", "zh": "那个，关于可怜新歌的搭档……  \n是不是也该选个合适的搭档了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "aee2e3c266de622a83c202b80be6a24dd4706cb19c7388bce6c9ffbb06af426c", "ja": "可憐と組むなら私みたいなのじゃなくて、\nもっとかわいい子のほうがいいと思うんですけど。", "zh": "要是和可怜搭档的话，比起我这样的，\n我觉得还是更可爱的女孩子比较好耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "77043d6736d5783b9e3f8ac307247736e72947dae71945e2c4e51219fb0a1377", "ja": "公演も近くなってきたことですし。\nここら辺で、ちゃんと決めませんか？", "zh": "公演也临近了。\n差不多该在这时候好好决定下来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e94be33135ef4181958fef75aff6792f87413f4a6a30bd01da44b3478fb708b", "ja": "いや、ちゃんと決めたつもりだけど。\nそれに今から変更なんて、可憐がなんて言うか……。", "zh": "不是，我觉得我们已经好好决定过了。  \n而且现在才要改的话，可怜会怎么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "5204999dd0636a096b9ea68b879951102217fa946d431eb2f70a11f7c93ce8c3", "ja": "確かに、可憐の意見も聞いてみないとですね。\nそれじゃ、ちょっと呼んできます。", "zh": "确实，也得听听可憐的意见才行。\n那我去叫她来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1058a54ecdcaffd353c943e2ec654556cf17989f1ac11603caf337b61c23c219", "ja": "あ、待ってくれ。俺も行くよ。", "zh": "啊，等一下。我也一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "56a16d68eb0eddf0db8de659ff3f0b55905d80ee41a23c3f4125a142034e88f7", "ja": "あっ、可憐。ちょうどよかったわ。\n今からレッスン？", "zh": "啊，可怜。来得正好。\n你现在要去训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "0be3df0e1e6385b7eae4ea4a7a0e8258514039e66ec9eab508b39dadfba4ee45", "ja": "あ、律子さん、{$P$}さんも……\nお、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "啊，律子姐，{$P$}先生也……  \n辛、辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eca8e58787c609fe39e939ea82038d55682a1664d4c5d3c83c6fce0317f2c738", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。\nちょっと話があるんだけど、今いいか？", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n我有点事想和你谈谈，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "d421b04e6c0d10ddf27813d5b7c6f0b63e77957b49abb42353ed95e19f32cad4", "ja": "あ、は、はい。練習は、まだ始まってないので……\nあの……お、お話って、なんでしょう……？", "zh": "啊，嗯、好的。练习还、还没开始……\n那个……您、您说的事情，是指什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "f8bc42781745b6095fd3df4e5a29e2967b613f64ea4c7fc89e8d8f2a048537b6", "ja": "今回の新曲のことなんだけど。私じゃなくて、\n別の誰かと歌ったほうがいいと思うのよ。", "zh": "是关于这次的新歌。我觉得不要和我一起，而是和其他什么人一起唱比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "453530aa72349ca62305c3f18950637524ce11f3c68feec170f3b66367c007c5", "ja": "え……！？\nあ、えっと……ど、どうして、ですか……？", "zh": "诶……！？\n啊，那个……为、为什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "3dec89283deb036cd82fd07e9cdaa691ad6aee1dfa8f31b95aedf54330e73268", "ja": "だって私は、もともと代役のつもりだったし。\n可憐も、それでいいわよね？", "zh": "因为我本来就是打算来当替补的。\n可怜也觉得这样就好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7e9b9ec62c8aef5b8ab56efab59c5b274d99b7427bc46fb4ed56ce7655f9fa0b", "ja": "律子は、こう言ってるんだけど……\n可憐はどう思う？", "zh": "律子是这么说的……\n可怜你怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "e2d995e3b9abc7901674b70927e7fa7f97dbdd8198686ae2aab3a64f965490cf", "ja": "あ、あの……私……。\nわ……私じゃ、ダメだったんでしょうか……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我……  \n难……难道我不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "234c74f4730738a1e65a552654d6e17ad28cab2e4e68ab9b55206f5add6066be", "ja": "可憐……？", "zh": "可怜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "31951858577b19cde39d5a5d054d399b346f7b6ea4816ddefe5ceaf557177b63", "ja": "レッスンに、つ、ついていくのがやっとで……。\n律子さんを、ガッカリさせてしまいましたか……？", "zh": "练习……我、我已经竭尽全力才能跟上了……。\n是不是让律子小姐失望了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "685f549e14e6206587594bcd5a9092aabdc7b2c62d68b145cfc2227acaee52a7", "ja": "いやいや、そういう話じゃなくて。可憐なら、\n私よりもっといいパートナーがって話……。", "zh": "不是不是，不是这个意思。我是说，要是可怜的话，比起我，肯定能找到更好的搭档……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "e116f8c14ceae16cf327892816af805b3f3ca6f9f3fa1725d2e7543820c8fcb1", "ja": "私……り、律子さんじゃないと、いやです……。\nせっかく、仲良くなれたのに……うぅ……。", "zh": "我……不、不行，我只要律子小姐……\n好不容易才和您变得亲近了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "a93036212a799abf314197ddd12902cec2413d58b3bbda59f3c2003d9d131323", "ja": "えっ！？　ち、ちょっと、可憐……！", "zh": "诶！？等、等一下，可怜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1022_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "cce638dc01b3f2a6a12c12b5fb2c5e4c2e58e544e69aa744cd4d7e2919d12410", "ja": "律子さん、可憐さん。あっ、仕掛け人さまもいらして\nたんですね！　そろそろ時間ですが……What！？", "zh": "律子小姐、可怜小姐。啊，制作人大人也在呀！\n差不多到时间了，不过……What！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "07cafc23ab8aa88c962560b5b0f947b5c335b29bf196a66826a000dce14871ce", "ja": "まあまあ……可憐ちゃん、大丈夫？\n何があったのかしら？", "zh": "好啦好啦……可怜，没事吧？\n这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "266077e1022fcd60962642725a149a2f5b75ccbebbfd29d6710352049cf80787", "ja": "もしかして、{$P$}さん？\nダメだよ、可憐さんをいじめちゃ！", "zh": "难道是{$P$}先生？\n不可以欺负可怜姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583", "ja": "えっと……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "435a024b3169d533056bebcc52d7de326e496dd993bd9b6a21a58db85d15218f", "ja": "ち、違うのよ育！　{$P$}の\nせいじゃなくて、私が可憐を泣かせちゃったの！", "zh": "不、不是这样的，育！不是{$P$}的错，是我把可怜弄哭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "94c2f055ecf8a99bb364531555c38926204cb56693ece29f872ca4ff68ba467d", "ja": "えっ？　律子さんが？", "zh": "诶？是律子小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "1fac908b52dbcb7addfa6cf4c290f8b9144d14e2a201d1434aa04d48a0399af4", "ja": "なるほど……お話はわかりました。\nけど、それは……。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白了。\n不过，那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "26f7b6c0e018e301e2decc60eb87b0bd0d2ee739bec39307a2b34675ddaafd64", "ja": "そうね……ちょっと言いにくいけど、\nそれは、律子さんがいけないと思うわ。", "zh": "是啊……虽然有点难开口，\n但我觉得，那是律子小姐不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "2d264dcb2d508300dcdc48ca4114b7fcfbb79b44452cc8b1369aad85ffa7c983", "ja": "ま、まあ、ちょっと一方的だったかなとは思うけど。\nでも私なりに、効果を考えた上での提案なんですよ？", "zh": "不、不管怎么说，我觉得确实有点单方面了。\n不过，这可是我经过一番效果考量后提出的建议哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "ee224d99e6cd45afd63fa0d2af49837e2e9fc573344a73d6c1eaf0e92512d25a", "ja": "ええと……たぶんですけど、\nそういう話では、ないんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "那个……我觉得大概不是在说那件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "ad4837617718c30bfc2616e631170ba728da669c16206b167d7104f62c3183de", "ja": "律子さん！　律子さんと可憐さんはデュオなんだから、\nふたりのことは、ふたりで話し合わないとダメだよ！", "zh": "律子小姐！律子小姐和可怜小姐是双人组合，\n所以两个人的事情，必须要两个人好好商量才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "9990aa7a587c70d6b8a49a525b5c9cd1e913515c939b4f0fb7289b8416be003a", "ja": "ではおふたりが戻るまで、私たちは\n稽古を進めておきましょうか。", "zh": "那么在两位回来之前，我们先继续排练吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7882cebd52730ba68fe83588c30fad64780cff67d38617252185b1e4f804797b", "ja": "ああ、そうしてくれると助かるよ。\n後は俺とふたりに任せてくれ。", "zh": "啊，那就拜托你们了。\n接下来交给我和她们两个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "428c875b27df36ae3dbc9fa760d1d7e1a34cb1ffb10fff29bdfba615d25614b3", "ja": "えっ？　ち、ちょっと、みんなまで……。", "zh": "咦？等、等等，怎么连大家也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "544f4c66968653eb4da12a62c264e3164081381c7f2f1e5f757ae72adcfaa140", "ja": "律子さんと可憐さんは、なかなおりするまで\nレッスンはおやすみでいいからね！", "zh": "律子小姐和可怜小姐，在和好之前\n不上练习课也可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_04_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "f90cfe4e2f38fbbe0713925482cff48922def8a6da54d829c296b984f5082f36", "ja": "それじゃ、私たちは先に行ってますね。\n……がんばって、可憐ちゃん。", "zh": "那么，我们就先走一步了。\n……加油，可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
